<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thank you for your time today and for committing to EverQuote's paid search Marketing Services program. I've summarized the details of your commitment and have outlined some next steps so you know what to expect as we get your paid search up and running.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Subscription Fee and Ad Spend Budget&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Your monthly subscription fee and ad spend budget are outlined below. Reminder that both of these are 50% cost share eligible and your first month's subscription fee will be prorated.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">Subscription Fee: </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">$250&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">Monthly Ad Spend Budget: </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{Add Agent's Ad Spend}</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Next Steps- Onboarding</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I have scheduled an Onboarding Call with a member of our Customer Success team on {add OB call date and time}. During this call, they will confirm your account settings and help get your account up and running. If you have any questions between now and your Onboarding call please don't hesitate to contact me. Thanks again and we look forward to working with you!&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Have a great day,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38">{{{Sender.Name}}}</p>
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>